WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Tow-N-Go branded fleet Reel asks: Could you name all 15 parts?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Labels identify the tongue jack, diamond-plate stone guard, trailer coupler, safety chains and footplate.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Further labels highlight the side door, marker lights, wheels, tires and tandem axles, then the open enclosed trailer.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Tow-N-Go booking card: trailer rental, trailer delivery and collection, pickup/transport/delivery. You load it. Tow-N-Go hauls it. Phone 778-215-3422; towandgotrailers.ca.
